TEXT -728 -32 Left 5 ;The generator is switched to the isolated network\nAfter 2s 100MW of load is switched to the network\nAfter 3.5s the second generator is synchronized\nNow each generator takes 50MW of the load\nAfter 4.5s the short circuit fault is switched on\nand after 100ms later is switched off\nThe short circuit current is fed by generator 1 and 2 \n(4kA+4kA at high voltage side of transformer)\nAfter switching off the fault the generators \npower output is again about 50MW per generator
TEXT -1240 -256 Left 2 !.options vntol=10 abstol=100m reltol=0.005 trtol=1\n.param Rgnd=1e6\n.param tdv=1 tdt=1 fn1=50 omega_n={2*pi*fn1}
